      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Temporomandibular disorders are only one of a host of different conditions that may result in orofacial pain. Hence, due to this multifactorial etiology, it is imperative to adopt a multidisciplinary approach when treating these patients. Listed in Table 3 are some of the conditions that must be considered when a dentist faces the dilemma of orofacial pain of unknown etiology in clinical practice."},
